<span id="id7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">gkwnsdn99@uos.ac.kr</span>, 
<span id="id8" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">haon@aim-intelligence.com</span>, 
<span id="id9" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">sangyoon@aim-intelligence.com</span>
