<section id="S4.SS3.SSS0.Px1" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Effect sizes (GPT<span id="S4.SS3.SSS0.Px1.1" class="ltx_text">-</span>4.1).</h4>

<div id="S4.SS3.SSS0.Px1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.SS3.SSS0.Px1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Cohen’s <math id="S4.SS3.SSS0.Px1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="h" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>h</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">h</annotation></semantics></math> indicates medium effects versus <span id="S4.SS3.SSS0.Px1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">numberize</span> (e.g., <span id="S4.SS3.SSS0.Px1.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">hyphenize</span>/<span id="S4.SS3.SSS0.Px1.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">pythonize</span> vs. <span id="S4.SS3.SSS0.Px1.p1.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">numberize</span>) and a moderate gap between <span id="S4.SS3.SSS0.Px1.p1.1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">Evolved_1</span> and <span id="S4.SS3.SSS0.Px1.p1.1.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">Evolved_2</span>; full pairwise values appear in Appendix.</p>
</div>
</section>
</section>
<section id="S4.SS4" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">4.4 </span>Evolution Across Generations</h3>

<div id="S4.SS4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.SS4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Table <a href="#S4.T2" title="Table 2 ‣ 4.4 Evolution Across Generations ‣ 4 Results ‣ X-Teaming Evolutionary M2S: Automated Discovery of Multi-turn to Single-turn Jailbreak Templates" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a> reports aggregate success by generation.
The system continued evolving through Gen 4 and <em id="S4.SS4.p1.1.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">converged</em> by Gen 5 under the stopping rule.</p>
</div>
<figure id="S4.T2" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 2: </span><span id="S4.T2.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">GPT<span id="S4.T2.3.1" class="ltx_text">-</span>4.1 only</span>. Evolution progress at threshold <math id="S4.T2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="0.70" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>0.70</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">0.70</annotation></semantics></math>.</figcaption>
<table id="S4.T2.4" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<thead class="ltx_thead">
<tr id="S4.T2.4.1" class="ltx_tr">
