<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Dataset Sources and Statistics</h2>

<div id="A1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Overview.</span> Our experiments use a comprehensive multi<span id="A1.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text">-</span>turn jailbreak dataset totaling <span id="A1.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">268,403</span> conversations drawn from <span id="A1.p1.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">12</span> distinct sources; the average conversation length is <span id="A1.p1.1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">3.23</span> turns.</p>
</div>
<section id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Primary sources and splits.</h4>

<div id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<ul id="A1.I1" class="ltx_itemize ltx_leftmargin_flush">
<li id="A1.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I1.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">HH-RLHF (Anthropic)</span> — <span id="A1.I1.i1.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">235,508</span> conversations (<span id="A1.I1.i1.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">87.7%</span>): helpful/harmless pairs spanning base, rejection<span id="A1.I1.i1.p1.1.4" class="ltx_text">-</span>sampled, and online variants <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bibx2" title="" class="ltx_ref">2</a>]</cite>.</p>
<ul id="A1.I1.i1.I1" class="ltx_itemize" style="--ltx-enum-leftmargin:1.25em;">
<li id="A1.I1.i1.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="A1.I1.i1.I1.i1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">–</span></span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i1.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.i1.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I1.i1.I1.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">hh-rlhf_helpful-rejection-sampled_rejected</span>: 37,683 (14.0%)</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i1.I1.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="A1.I1.i1.I1.i2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">–</span></span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i1.I1.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.i1.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I1.i1.I1.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">hh-rlhf_helpful-rejection-sampled_chosen</span>: 37,650 (14.0%)</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i1.I1.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="A1.I1.i1.I1.i3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">–</span></span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i1.I1.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.i1.I1.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I1.i1.I1.i3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">hh-rlhf_helpful-base_rejected</span>: 32,817 (12.2%)</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i1.I1.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="A1.I1.i1.I1.i4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">–</span></span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i1.I1.i4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.i1.I1.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I1.i1.I1.i4.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">hh-rlhf_helpful-base_chosen</span>: 32,747 (12.2%)</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i1.I1.i5" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="A1.I1.i1.I1.i5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">–</span></span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i1.I1.i5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.i1.I1.i5.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I1.i1.I1.i5.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">hh-rlhf_harmless-base_chosen</span>: 32,142 (12.0%)</p>
</div></li>
