<p id="A1.I1.i1.I1.i8.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I1.i1.I1.i8.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">hh-rlhf_helpful-online_chosen</span>: 15,193 (5.7%)</p>
