<p id="A1.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I1.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">XGuard-Train</span> — 30,126 (<span id="A1.I1.i2.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">11.2%</span>): multilingual safety data for cross<span id="A1.I1.i2.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text">-</span>lingual jailbreak scenarios <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bibx10" title="" class="ltx_ref">10</a>]</cite>.</p>
</div></li>
