<div id="A1.I1.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I1.i3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">SafeMTData</span> — 2,273 (<span id="A1.I1.i3.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">0.8%</span>): specialized multi<span id="A1.I1.i3.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text">-</span>turn safety data <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bibx11" title="" class="ltx_ref">11</a>]</cite>.</p>
<ul id="A1.I1.i3.I1" class="ltx_itemize" style="--ltx-enum-leftmargin:1.25em;">
