<div id="A1.I1.i3.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.i3.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I1.i3.I1.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">SafeMTData_1K</span>: 1,673 (0.6%)</p>
