<p id="A1.I1.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I1.i4.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">MHJ (Multi<span id="A1.I1.i4.p1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text">-</span>turn Harmful Jailbreak)</span> — 496 (<span id="A1.I1.i4.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">0.2%</span>): expertly crafted multi<span id="A1.I1.i4.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text">-</span>turn attack sequences <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bibx7" title="" class="ltx_ref">7</a>]</cite>.</p>
