<td id="A9.T5.2.5.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_bb">2.88</td>
<td id="A9.T5.2.5.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_bb">50</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</figure>
<figure id="A9.F2" class="ltx_figure"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2509.08729v1/m2s_model_vulnerability.svg" id="A9.F2.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:405/300;" width="405" height="300"></object>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 2: </span><span id="A9.F2.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Model vulnerability at <math id="A9.F2.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\theta\!\geq\!0.70" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi><mo lspace="0.108em">≥</mo><mn>0.70</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\theta\!\geq\!0.70</annotation></semantics></math> (judge fixed).</span>
Macro-averaged success rate by target model (averaged over templates), with 95% Wilson CIs; each bar aggregates <math id="A9.F2.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N{=}5\times 100" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mn>100</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N{=}5\times 100</annotation></semantics></math> prompts.
Bars with zero success are annotated <em id="A9.F2.5" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">IMMUNE</em>.</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="A9.F3" class="ltx_figure"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2509.08729v1/m2s_template_ranking.svg" id="A9.F3.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:405/300;" width="405" height="300"></object>
