Macro-averaged success rate by template family (averaged over models), with 95% Wilson CIs; each bar aggregates <math id="A9.F3.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N{=}5\times 100" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mn>100</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N{=}5\times 100</annotation></semantics></math> prompts.</figcaption>
</figure>
</section>
